---
// ANI for 1.2: the same kind of model in two homes. Cloud: your words travel to a data centre and back.
// Local: they never leave the laptop. CSS motion only; still frames when the visitor prefers less motion.
---
<figure class="cs-fig th">
  <span class="cs-figtag">Animation</span>
  <div class="th-grid">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 320 210" role="img" aria-labelledby="th-a">
      <title id="th-a">Cloud AI: your words travel over the internet to a data centre and the answer travels back</title>
      <text x="160" y="20" class="th-h">Cloud AI</text>
      <path class="th-wire" d="M62 150 C 90 70, 130 60, 160 70 C 190 60, 230 70, 258 150" />
      <g class="th-cloud"><ellipse cx="160" cy="70" rx="40" ry="20" /><text x="160" y="74" class="th-s">internet</text></g>
      <g class="th-laptop"><rect x="30" y="132" width="64" height="40" rx="4" /><rect x="22" y="172" width="80" height="7" rx="3" /><text x="62" y="198" class="th-s">your laptop</text></g>
      <g class="th-dc"><rect x="232" y="118" width="54" height="62" rx="4" /><line x1="240" y1="134" x2="278" y2="134" /><line x1="240" y1="148" x2="278" y2="148" /><line x1="240" y1="162" x2="278" y2="162" /><text x="259" y="198" class="th-s">data centre</text></g>
      <circle class="th-dot th-go" r="6" />
      <circle class="th-dot th-back" r="6" />
    </svg>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 320 210" role="img" aria-labelledby="th-b">
      <title id="th-b">Local AI: the model runs inside your own computer, so your words never leave it</title>
      <text x="160" y="20" class="th-h">Local AI</text>
      <g class="th-laptop"><rect x="70" y="52" width="180" height="110" rx="6" /><rect x="50" y="162" width="220" height="12" rx="4" /></g>
      <rect class="th-model" x="128" y="78" width="64" height="40" rx="6" /><text x="160" y="103" class="th-s th-mt">model</text>
      <path class="th-wire th-in" d="M110 140 C 110 100, 120 98, 128 98 M192 98 C 200 98, 210 100, 210 140" />
      <circle class="th-dot th-loop" r="6" />
      <g class="th-nowifi"><path d="M266 58 a 18 18 0 0 1 28 0 M271 64 a 11 11 0 0 1 18 0" /><circle cx="280" cy="70" r="2.5" /><line x1="264" y1="76" x2="296" y2="50" /></g>
      <text x="160" y="198" class="th-s">your laptop, no internet needed</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>The dot is your question. With cloud AI it crosses the internet to a company's computers and the answer comes back. With local AI the model sits on your own machine, so the question and the answer stay with you.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .th-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 260px), 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .th svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  .th-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; text-anchor: middle; fill: var(--ink); }
  .th-s { font-size: 12px; text-anchor: middle; fill: var(--muted); }
  .th-mt { fill: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
  .th-laptop rect, .th-dc rect { fill: var(--accent-soft); stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .th-dc line { stroke: var(--muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .th-cloud ellipse { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--muted); stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .th-wire { fill: none; stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 3; }
  .th-model { fill: var(--good-soft); stroke: var(--good); stroke-width: 2; }
  .th-nowifi path { fill: none; stroke: var(--muted); stroke-width: 2; }
  .th-nowifi circle { fill: var(--muted); }
  .th-nowifi line { stroke: var(--bad); stroke-width: 2.5; }
  .th-dot { fill: var(--accent); }
  .th-go { offset-path: path("M62 150 C 90 70, 130 60, 160 70 C 190 60, 230 70, 258 150"); animation: th-move 4s linear infinite; }
  .th-back { fill: var(--good); offset-path: path("M258 150 C 230 70, 190 60, 160 70 C 130 60, 90 70, 62 150"); animation: th-move 4s linear infinite 2s; opacity: 0; }
  .th-loop { offset-path: path("M110 140 C 110 100, 120 98, 160 98 C 200 98, 210 100, 210 140 C 210 150, 110 150, 110 140"); animation: th-loop 3s linear infinite; }
  @keyframes th-move { 0% { offset-distance: 0%; opacity: 1; } 48% { offset-distance: 100%; opacity: 1; } 50%, 100% { offset-distance: 100%; opacity: 0; } }
  @keyframes th-loop { to { offset-distance: 100%; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .th-dot { animation: none; offset-distance: 50%; opacity: 1; } .th-back { display: none; } }
</style>
